<title>UK: Reliance Industries prices 150 mln stg 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Reliance Industries prices 150 mln stg 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by joint lead managers HSBC, Merrill Lynch and UBS has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RELIANCE INDUSTRIES LTD</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     8.75	MATURITY    13.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.303    PAY DATE    13.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    99.303    SPREAD	+165 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB+	 DENOMS (K) **	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.50	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT 2007 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>		*144A 250K AND REG S 10K</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
